  "title": "PHC Recorder",
  "html": "\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull work-detail has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide work-detail__layout is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\t<h1 class=\"work-detail__title wp-block-post-title\">PHC Recorder</h1><div class=\"work-ctas\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Project links\"><a class=\"work-cta work-cta--download\" href=\"https://github.com/p-haochen/phc-recorder/releases/download/v1.0.1/phc.recorder-v1.0.1.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-work-cta-type=\"download\"><span>DOWNLOAD</span></a><a class=\"work-cta work-cta--github\" href=\"https://github.com/p-haochen/phc-recorder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-work-cta-type=\"github\"><span>GITHUB</span></a></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"taxonomy-work_category work-detail__categories wp-block-post-terms\"><a href=\"/work/\" rel=\"tag\">LAB</a></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"work-detail__year work-year wp-block-paragraph\">2026</p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<figure data-cover-orientation=\"landscape\" class=\"work-detail__hero wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img width=\"1448\" height=\"1086\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PHC-Recorder-Cover.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-post-image\" alt=\"PHC Recorder cover showing the audio recording interface\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PHC-Recorder-Cover.png 1448w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PHC-Recorder-Cover-300x225.png 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PHC-Recorder-Cover-1024x768.png 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PHC-Recorder-Cover-768x576.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1448px) 100vw, 1448px\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" /></figure>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content work-detail__post-content wp-block-post-content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-post-content-is-layout-constrained\"><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">PHC Recorder is a free and open-source multichannel recording utility for Cycling ’74 Max, supporting 1–64 channels with synchronized mono or interleaved WAV recording.</p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">PHC Recorder began as a reusable recording module for my own multichannel Max/MSP performance and installation workflows. It was later developed into a standalone package that can be reused across projects and shared with the Max community.</p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Credits</h2><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Concept / Design / Development: PO HAO CHEN</p></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"work-media\"><section class=\"work-media__section work-media-gallery work-media-gallery--phc-recorder\" aria-labelledby=\"work-media-gallery-257\"><h2 id=\"work-media-gallery-257\" class=\"work-media__heading\">Gallery</h2><div class=\"work-media-gallery__grid\"><figure class=\"work-media-gallery__item\"><a class=\"work-media-gallery__link\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/attachment1-20260923.webp\" data-work-gallery-item data-work-gallery-index=\"0\" data-work-gallery-count=\"2\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Open image 1 of 2: PHC Recorder product overview with recording interface, features, and multichannel controls\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/attachment1-20260923-1024x768.webp\" class=\"work-media-gallery__image\" alt=\"PHC Recorder product overview with recording interface, features, and multichannel controls\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 700px) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 1599px) calc((100vw - 8rem) / 2), 720px\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/attachment1-20260923-1024x768.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/attachment1-20260923-300x225.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/attachment1-20260923-768x576.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/attachment1-20260923.webp 1448w\" /></a></figure><figure class=\"work-media-gallery__item\"><a class=\"work-media-gallery__link\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PHC-Recorder-Interface.webp\" data-work-gallery-item data-work-gallery-index=\"1\" data-work-gallery-count=\"2\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Open image 2 of 2: PHC Recorder 16-channel interleaved recording interface\"><img width=\"800\" height=\"763\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PHC-Recorder-Interface.webp\" class=\"work-media-gallery__image\" alt=\"PHC Recorder 16-channel interleaved recording interface\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 700px) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 1599px) calc((100vw - 8rem) / 2), 720px\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PHC-Recorder-Interface.webp 800w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PHC-Recorder-Interface-300x286.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PHC-Recorder-Interface-768x732.webp 768w\" /></a></figure></div></section></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\t\n</div>\n\n",
